    "description": "Multiple choice reasoning question about resistor environment agent interactions QA - Thought Action",
    "examples": [
      {
        "input": "This is a task from an agent benchmark. Can you return the `mapped_rxn` associated with the template that, when applied to the molecule C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO[Si](C)(C)C(C)(C)C, reproduces the reaction: In the Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons reaction, the reaction of aldehydes or ketones with stabilized phosphorus ylides (phosphonate carbanions) leads to olefins with excellent E-selectivity. The overall reaction is a carbon-carbon bond formed, while a carbon-phosphorus bond and a carbon-oxygen bond are broken. As a result, an 'aliphatic carboxylic acid', and  'C-C double bonds' groups are formed. Note that the hints are describing the forward reaction, but you have to perform the retrosynthetic step\n\nBelow are a few scenarios that may contain an agent's correct/incorrect thought-action pairs.\n\nWhich scenario corresponds to a correct/incorrect tought-action pair?",
        "target_scores": {
          "<thought>\nNow let me search for templates that would form C-C double bonds (in the forward direction) from a carbonyl. This would be the Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons reaction in the forward direction. In the retrosynthetic direction, it would break the C-C double bond to form a carbonyl.\n\nLet me search for templates that form C-C double bonds:\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO[Si](C)(C)C(C)(C)C\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": null,\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"C-C double bonds\"],\n  \"bonds_broken\": null,\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-6\"],\n  \"bonds_order_changed\": null,\n  \"limit\": 50\n}\n</action_input>": 1.0,
          "<thought>\nLet me analyze the task:\n\n1. I need to find a template that, when applied to a molecule, reproduces a Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons reaction\n2. The reaction description (forward): aldehydes/ketones + stabilized phosphorus ylides \u2192 olefins with E-selectivity\n3. Forward reaction: C-C bond formed, C-P bond broken, C=O bond broken\n4. Forward reaction: forms 'aliphatic carboxylic acid' and 'C-C double bonds'\n5. I need to perform the RETROSYNTHETIC step (reverse of forward)\n\nFrom the available input data, I have precursors from a previous template application. The molecule appears to be: `C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO[Si](C)(C)C(C)(C)C` (with various protecting groups in the variants).\n\nFor the retrosynthetic step of Horner-Wadsworth-Emmons:\n- In reverse: an olefin (with C=C double bond) is broken back to a carbonyl compound and a phosphonate\n- Bonds broken (in retro): C-C double bond\n- Bonds formed (in retro): C=O bond, C-P bond\n- Functional groups broken (in retro): C-C double bonds, aliphatic carboxylic acid\n- Functional groups formed (in retro): carbonyl groups\n\nLet me first get the target molecule from the precursors. The deprotected version would be the actual product. Let me search for templates matching these criteria.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"C-C double bonds\", \"aliphatic carboxylic acid\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": null,\n  \"bonds_broken\": [\"6-6\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-8\", \"6-15\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nLet me try a simple search - just looking for templates that break C-C double bonds and form C=O bonds, without specifying functional groups:\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO[Si](C)(C)C(C)(C)C\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": null,\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": null,\n  \"bonds_broken\": [\"6-6\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-8\"],\n  \"bonds_order_changed\": [\"6-6 (2.0->1.0)\"],\n  \"limit\": 20\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nLet me try a broader search without specifying all the criteria. Maybe I should just search for templates that break C-C double bonds and form carbonyl groups, without being too specific about the bonds.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"C/C(=C/[C@H]1O[C@@H](C/C=C/C=C/C(=O)O)C[C@H](O)[C@H]1C)CO[Si](C)(C)C(C)(C)C\",\n  \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"C-C double bonds\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"ketones\"],\n  \"bonds_broken\": null,\n  \"bonds_formed\": null,\n  \"limit\": 20\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0
        }
      }
